WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Ryu starts the close standing-medium confirm with Ken in the corner.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.200
Ryu kicks Ken against the corner with heavy High Blade Kick.

3
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.300
Ryu catches the corner juggle with medium Shoryuken.

4
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:03.700
Ken falls beside the corner after the Shoryuken juggle.
